## 十九、最终统一 API

```python
adc = AsyncBehavioralSARADC(
    topology=topology,
    switching_policy=switching_policy,
    comparator=comparator,
    timing=timing,
)

adc.reset()

cal_report = adc.run_calibration(
    avg_pairs=128,
    rng=calibration_rng,
)

assert cal_report.valid
assert adc.mode == ADCOperatingMode.READY

conversion = adc.convert(
    vinp=vinp,
    vinn=vinn,
    rng=conversion_rng,
)

print(conversion.code)
print(conversion.decisions)
print(conversion.total_conversion_time_s)
```

转换结果必须包含：

```python
@dataclass(frozen=True)
class ADCConversionResult:
    physical: AsyncSARConversionResult
    decoded: DecodeResult
    calibration_version: int
```

